listitem.para:
the version set forth in the dedicated, aforementioned
          version metaslot of the schema – we will call
          that the “schema version proper”;

the version that may appear in whatever “canonical” URI is
          used to publish the schema – we will call that the “publication URI
          version”;

example.programlisting:
{
    "name": "Acme Corporation",
    "foundation": "1935-06-22",
    "founder":
    {
        "first_name": "Marvin",
        "last_name": "Acme",
        "email": "marvin@acme.example.com"
    },
    "type": "commercial"
}
